  "claim": "The capacity of the stadium that Colección Privada was filmed on in October 10, 2000 was 15,500.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Colección Privada. Sentence: The compilation was released in two different formats, the 2CD+DVD edition, containing the greatest hits album with a remixes album and a bonus disc with music videos including the previously unreleased video \"Perra Enamorada\", and the 3CD+DVD Lujo-Box Set containing her \"Tour Minage\", filmed on October 10, 2000, in Palacio de los Deportes, in Madrid, Spain.\nPage: Palacio de Deportes de la Comunidad de Madrid. Sentence: Its capacity is 15,000 people for basketball matches and 15,500 for concerts (with standing public ramp).",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Colección Privada. Sentence: The compilation was released in two different formats, the 2CD+DVD edition, containing the greatest hits album with a remixes album and a bonus disc with music videos including the previously unreleased video \"Perra Enamorada\", and the 3CD+DVD Lujo-Box Set containing her \"Tour Minage\", filmed on October 10, 2000, in Palacio de los Deportes, in Madrid, Spain.\nPage: Palacio de Deportes de la Comunidad de Madrid. Sentence: Its capacity is 15,000 people for basketball matches and 15,500 for concerts (with standing public ramp).",
