        "original_id": "162fa6b6-1d16-5b4e-881c-d0ea777d146f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Colección Privada editions, Tour Minage\n- Places: Palacio de los Deportes, Madrid, Spain\n- Topics: release formats, venue capacity\n\nFacts:\n- Colección Privada was released in two formats: a 2CD+DVD edition and a 3CD+DVD Lujo-Box Set edition.\n- The 2CD+DVD edition of Colección Privada included a greatest hits album, a remixes album, and a bonus DVD with music videos, including the previously unreleased video \"Perra Enamorada.\"\n- On October 10, 2000, Tour Minage was filmed at Palacio de los Deportes in Madrid, Spain.\n- The 3CD+DVD Lujo-Box Set edition of Colección Privada included Tour Minage.\n- Palacio de los Deportes has a capacity of 15,000 people for basketball matches.\n- Palacio de los Deportes has a capacity of 15,500 people for concerts with a standing public ramp.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "1e41fc46-5672-5284-95eb-203c91b2cc32",
        "text": "Page: Colección Privada. Sentence: The compilation was released in two different formats, the 2CD+DVD edition, containing the greatest hits album with a remixes album and a bonus disc with music videos including the previously unreleased video \"Perra Enamorada\", and the 3CD+DVD Lujo-Box Set containing her \"Tour Minage\", filmed on October 10, 2000, in Palacio de los Deportes, in Madrid, Spain.\nPage: Palacio de Deportes de la Comunidad de Madrid. Sentence: Its capacity is 15,000 people for basketball matches and 15,500 for concerts (with standing public ramp).",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
